# Superwall — seven detuned saws on oscillator 1, a little noise of
# each card's own on top, two cards per note spread wide: the wall a
# hard-techno drop or a trance break opens into. Detune and mix are the
# two knobs that matter: `supersaw_detune` 0.3 is thick, 0.6 is a swarm.
waveform 2
supersaw 1
supersaw_detune 0.35
supersaw_mix 0.7
osc2_level 0
osc3_level 0
sub 0.25
noise_osc 0.08
noise_mode 2
noise_cutoff 3000
unison 2
unison_detune 6
spread 0.9
cutoff 5200
resonance 0.3
key_track 0.4
filter_env 0.8
filter_attack 0.01
filter_decay 0.6
filter_sustain 0.6
filter_release 0.6
attack 0.01
decay 0.6
sustain 0.85
release 0.7
